 "DialogText": "You are in Valemont, a village in the Six Faced World. That portal is why we keep watch at the walls. It spills more mana into the countryside than this land can disperse. Where enough mana particles collide, a monster can take shape. Those creatures have no parents; mana itself gives them a body. We are still searching for a way to close the portal. Until then, we protect the people living beside it.",
